{"sha": "7e34350fa8804832be3093b01f85cdd81b3f061e5a275a018af13a2327df1821", "body": ["\\chapter{观察世界：五种感官}\\label{ch:g1:five-senses}", "", "头顶某处，有一只鸟在歌唱。面包闻起来是热的。路面", "隔着袜子摸上去是冷的。做任何其他事情之前，物理学", "先要看、听、摸：本章讲的是用五种感官", "观察世界 --- 以及它们会如何捉弄我们。", "", "\\section{五种感官}", "", "\\begin{definition}[五种感官]\\label{def:g1:five-senses:senses}", "\\emph{感官}\\index{感官}是身体了解", "世界的一种方式。我们有五种：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item \\emph{视觉}\\index{视觉} --- 眼睛看见光、颜色和", "        形状；", "  \\item \\emph{听觉}\\index{听觉} --- 耳朵听见声音；", "  \\item \\emph{触觉}\\index{触觉} --- 皮肤感觉粗糙或光滑、", "        温暖或寒冷；", "  \\item \\emph{嗅觉}\\index{嗅觉} --- 鼻子闻到温热的面包；", "  \\item \\emph{味觉}\\index{味觉} --- 舌头尝到甜、咸、", "        酸。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.8]", "  \\foreach \\x/\\name in {0/sight, 2.4/hearing, 4.8/touch, 7.2/smell,", "      9.6/taste} {", "    \\draw[thick, omDef] (\\x,0) circle (0.9);", "    \\node[below, font=\\small] at (\\x,-1.1) {\\name};", "  }", "  % eye", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) ellipse (0.55 and 0.3);", "  \\fill[omDef] (0,0) circle (0.18);", "  \\fill (0,0) circle (0.09);", "  \\fill[white] (0.06,0.07) circle (0.03);", "  % ear: outer contour over the top, down to the lobe, plus inner ridge", "  \\draw[thick] (2.12,0.3)", "    .. controls (2.1,0.62) and (2.42,0.72) .. (2.66,0.52)", "    .. controls (2.88,0.32) and (2.86,-0.08) .. (2.68,-0.32)", "    .. controls (2.55,-0.5) and (2.4,-0.62) .. (2.26,-0.6)", "    .. controls (2.1,-0.58) and (2.06,-0.42) .. (2.14,-0.32);", "  \\draw[thick] (2.24,0.28)", "    .. controls (2.26,0.46) and (2.5,0.5) .. (2.6,0.32)", "    .. controls (2.7,0.12) and (2.64,-0.08) .. (2.5,-0.16);", "  % hand print: palm and five fingers", "  \\fill[omDef!30] (4.72,-0.22) ellipse (0.34 and 0.28);", "  \\draw[thick] (4.72,-0.22) ellipse (0.34 and 0.28);", "  \\foreach \\a/\\r in {135/0.5, 108/0.56, 84/0.58, 60/0.54} {", "    \\fill[omDef!30] (4.72,-0.22) ++(\\a:\\r)", "      ellipse [x radius=0.085, y radius=0.17, rotate=\\a-90];", "    \\draw[thick] (4.72,-0.22) ++(\\a:\\r)", "      ellipse [x radius=0.085, y radius=0.17, rotate=\\a-90];", "  }", "  \\fill[omDef!30] (4.72,-0.22) ++(170:0.46)", "    ellipse [x radius=0.08, y radius=0.14, rotate=60];", "  \\draw[thick] (4.72,-0.22) ++(170:0.46)", "    ellipse [x radius=0.08, y radius=0.14, rotate=60];", "  % nose in profile: brow, bridge sloping down-left, rounded tip,", "  % nostril wing curling back", "  \\draw[thick] (7.5,0.62)", "    .. controls (7.32,0.4) and (7.16,0.14) .. (7.1,-0.08)", "    .. controls (7.05,-0.26) and (7.14,-0.4) .. (7.3,-0.4)", "    .. controls (7.4,-0.4) and (7.46,-0.34) .. (7.46,-0.26);", "  \\draw[thick] (7.46,-0.26)", "    .. controls (7.56,-0.3) and (7.6,-0.42) .. (7.5,-0.48)", "    .. controls (7.42,-0.53) and (7.3,-0.49) .. (7.28,-0.42);", "  \\fill (7.38,-0.44) ellipse (0.05 and 0.033);", "  % lips", "  \\draw[thick] (9.2,0.06) .. controls (9.4,0.24) and (9.52,0.12) ..", "    (9.6,0.16) .. controls (9.68,0.12) and (9.8,0.24) .. (10.0,0.06);", "  \\draw[thick] (9.2,0.06) .. controls (9.45,-0.28) and (9.75,-0.28)", "    .. (10.0,0.06);", "  \\draw[thick] (9.34,0.02) .. controls (9.6,-0.08) .. (9.86,0.02);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 五种感官：眼、耳、手、鼻、舌 --- 世界与你之间的", "五扇门。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[一个苹果，五种感官]\\label{ex:g1:five-senses:apple}", "吃一个苹果会用到每一种感官：你\\emph{看到}它红色的果皮，你", "\\emph{摸到}它在手中光滑而圆润，你\\emph{听到}", "咀嚼的脆响，你\\emph{闻到}它的香气，你\\emph{尝到}它甜美的", "果汁。五种感官，一个苹果。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\includegraphics[width=0.52\\linewidth]{images/book1/ai/g1-five-senses-apple.jpg}", "", "{\\small 一个苹果供五种感官共享：眼睛看见它的红色，手摸到它光滑的表皮，耳朵听见缺掉那一口的咬响，鼻子闻到它的香气，舌头留住了它的味道。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[试一试：听声散步]\\label{ex:g1:five-senses:sounds}", "安静地坐着，闭上眼睛，数一数你身边的声音，", "数上一小会儿：汽车、说话声、风声和你自己的呼吸。闭上眼睛后，", "耳朵会察觉那些忙碌的眼睛让你错过的声音。多数人", "会发现 $4$ 或 $5$ 种之前没注意到的声音。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{remark}[感官的保护作用]\\label{rem:g1:five-senses:danger}", "感官也是守卫。鼻子常常先于眼睛闻到烟味，", "而后才看见火；皮肤会让手从热锅上缩回；苦味会提醒：", "“不要咽下这个”。绝不要故意去尝或去闻", "不认识的东西，先问大人。守卫发挥作用时，", "就要小心对待它们。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{仔细观察}", ""]}